 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "This map says Greenland is as big as Africa.",
   "t0": 0.101,
   "t1": 2.967,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 12,
   "syl_per_s": 5.31
  },
  {
   "text": "It's not even as big as Algeria.",
   "t0": 3.114,
   "t1": 5.351,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 10,
   "syl_per_s": 5.67
  },
  {
   "text": "Excuse me?",
   "t0": 5.63,
   "t1": 6.073,
   "speaker": "greenland",
   "gag": "excuse"
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the trick.",
   "t0": 6.303,
   "t1": 6.835,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 3,
   "syl_per_s": 4.31
  },
  {
   "text": "To flatten a round Earth, this map stretches land more and more toward the poles.",
   "t0": 7.128,
   "t1": 11.004,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 18,
   "syl_per_s": 4.55
  },
  {
   "text": "Up where Greenland sits, that's about SIXTEEN times too big.",
   "t0": 11.388,
   "t1": 15.573,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 13,
   "syl_per_s": 4.06
  },
  {
   "text": "So let's drag Greenland down to the equator, where the map tells the truth...",
   "t0": 16.679,
   "t1": 20.827,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 17,
   "syl_per_s": 5.27
  },
  {
   "text": "Watch it shrink.",
   "t0": 21.043,
   "t1": 22.076,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 3,
   "syl_per_s": 4.17
  },
  {
   "text": "And shrink.",
   "t0": 22.629,
   "t1": 23.492,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 2,
   "syl_per_s": 3.37
  },
  {
   "text": "And SHRINK.",
   "t0": 23.762,
   "t1": 25.02,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 2,
   "syl_per_s": 2.46
  },
  {
   "text": "Wait... what?!",
   "t0": 25.5,
   "t1": 26.084,
   "speaker": "greenland",
   "gag": "waitwhat"
  },
  {
   "text": "Now drop it on Africa.",
   "t0": 26.454,
   "t1": 27.501,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 7,
   "syl_per_s": 5.82
  },
  {
   "text": "Africa is FOURTEEN times bigger.",
   "t0": 27.805,
   "t1": 30.506,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 9,
   "syl_per_s": 4.32
  },
  {
   "text": "Even Algeria is bigger than Greenland.",
   "t0": 31.323,
   "t1": 32.885,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 11,
   "syl_per_s": 5.82
  },
  {
   "text": "So is DR Congo.",
   "t0": 33.298,
   "t1": 34.984,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 6,
   "syl_per_s": 4.27
  },
  {
   "text": "Hi, tiny.",
   "t0": 35.53,
   "t1": 36.164,
   "speaker": "algeria",
   "gag": "hitiny"
  },
  {
   "text": "In fact, put the USA, China, India, and all of Europe outside Russia together...",
   "t0": 36.576,
   "t1": 42.131,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 24,
   "syl_per_s": 5.24
  },
  {
   "text": "and Africa is STILL bigger.",
   "t0": 42.538,
   "t1": 44.038,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 8,
   "syl_per_s": 5.82
  },
  {
   "text": "With room to spare.",
   "t0": 44.603,
   "t1": 45.723,
